Value NEIGHBOR (\S+)
Value REMOTE_AS (\d+)
Value BGP_STATE (\w+)
Value UPTIME (\S+)
Value REMOTE_ROUTER_ID (\S+)
Value LOCAL_ROUTER_ID (\S+)
Value HOLD_TIME (\d+)
Value KEEPALIVE_INTERVAL (\d+)
Value ACCEPTED_PREFIXES (\d+)
Value CONNECTIONS_ESTABLISHED (\d+)
Value CONNECTIONS_DROPPED (\d+)
Value MESSAGES_SENT (\d+)
Value MESSAGES_RECEIVED (\d+)
Value LAST_RESET (\S+.*)

Start
  ^BGP neighbor is ${NEIGHBOR}, remote AS ${REMOTE_AS}
  ^  BGP version \d+, remote router ID ${REMOTE_ROUTER_ID}, local router ID ${LOCAL_ROUTER_ID}
  ^  BGP state = ${BGP_STATE}, up for ${UPTIME}
  ^  Hold time is ${HOLD_TIME}, keepalive interval is ${KEEPALIVE_INTERVAL}
  ^    Total:\s+${MESSAGES_SENT}\s+${MESSAGES_RECEIVED}
  ^  ${ACCEPTED_PREFIXES} accepted prefixes
  ^  Connections established ${CONNECTIONS_ESTABLISHED}; dropped ${CONNECTIONS_DROPPED}
  ^  Last reset ${LAST_RESET} -> Record




